The 7th season of the Russian QuakeWorld League began in 2005, from February to June. This time, non-professional players were invited. At the beginning, everyone was divided into eight groups, in which opponents played each other. After that, the best in the groups was placed in the high bracket. The worst in the groups was placed in the low bracket. With full double elimination.

